<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Imports take heavy toll on Conshu earnings.</title>
<headline>Imports take heavy toll on Conshu earnings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     15.7	  vs 79.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   7.6	   vs 37.8</p>
<p>    Trading profit	  22.7	  vs 71.0</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   11.9	  vs 12.1</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.2	   vs 21.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		  771.2	 vs 781.7</p>
<p>Full name: Conshu Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it had been hit by a continued surge in footwear imports.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
